{"dur": 28.37, "fps": 30, "segments": [{"id": "hook", "text": "Un centimètre.", "t0": 1.2, "t1": 2.286, "words": [{"w": "Un", "t": 1.2}, {"w": "centimètre.", "t": 1.433}]}, {"id": "suspense", "text": "C'est tout ce qui sépare un ouvrage sain… d'un ouvrage à reprendre.", "t0": 3.186, "t1": 6.919, "words": [{"w": "C'est", "t": 3.186}, {"w": "tout", "t": 3.497}, {"w": "ce", "t": 3.756}, {"w": "qui", "t": 3.912}, {"w": "sépare", "t": 4.119}, {"w": "un", "t": 4.482}, {"w": "ouvrage", "t": 4.638}, {"w": "sain…", "t": 5.053}, {"w": "d'un", "t": 5.623}, {"w": "ouvrage", "t": 5.882}, {"w": "à", "t": 6.297}, {"w": "reprendre.", "t": 6.401}]}, {"id": "quoi", "text": "Un centimètre d'enrobage en moins, sur une poutre exposée à la pluie.", "t0": 7.619, "t1": 11.69, "words": [{"w": "Un", "t": 7.619}, {"w": "centimètre", "t": 7.799}, {"w": "d'enrobage", "t": 8.457}, {"w": "en", "t": 9.116}, {"w": "moins,", "t": 9.295}, {"w": "sur", "t": 9.655}, {"w": "une", "t": 9.894}, {"w": "poutre", "t": 10.133}, {"w": "exposée", "t": 10.552}, {"w": "à", "t": 11.031}, {"w": "la", "t": 11.151}, {"w": "pluie.", "t": 11.331}]}, {"id": "effet", "text": "L'acier rouille. Il gonfle. Et le béton éclate. Dix ans plus tard.", "t0": 12.07, "t1": 16.696, "words": [{"w": "L'acier", "t": 12.07}, {"w": "rouille.", "t": 12.657}, {"w": "Il", "t": 13.245}, {"w": "gonfle.", "t": 13.465}, {"w": "Et", "t": 13.979}, {"w": "le", "t": 14.199}, {"w": "béton", "t": 14.419}, {"w": "éclate.", "t": 14.86}, {"w": "Dix", "t": 15.374}, {"w": "ans", "t": 15.668}, {"w": "plus", "t": 15.961}, {"w": "tard.", "t": 16.329}]}, {"id": "civrebar", "text": "CivRebar AI applique l'enrobage du projet. Sur chaque barre, sans oublier.", "t0": 17.076, "t1": 22.546, "words": [{"w": "CivRebar", "t": 17.076}, {"w": "AI", "t": 17.759}, {"w": "applique", "t": 17.987}, {"w": "l'enrobage", "t": 18.671}, {"w": "du", "t": 19.507}, {"w": "projet.", "t": 19.735}, {"w": "Sur", "t": 20.267}, {"w": "chaque", "t": 20.571}, {"w": "barre,", "t": 21.102}, {